	(text "Some pins are used for bootstrapping, and thus\nthey must have the correct state when booting:\nGPIO- state - reason\n0   - FLOAT - Allows code to be downloaded\n46  - LOW/FLOAT - Download boot mode\n		- Only checked if 0 is LOW\n45  - LOW/FLOAT - Flash voltage\n		- Can be disabled using by an eFuse\n\nWeak pull-down on IO0, IO45, IO46 (strapping pins)\nWeak pull-up on IO43, IO44 (UART0 pins)\n\nADC1 (10 channels) available on GPIO's 1-10\nADC2 on GPIO's 11-18. Not available with WiFi\n\nNo DAC"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 101.6 116.84 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0233bca6-7e57-4c86-bc99-a4d8afcc218e")
	)
	(text "For fast SPI, use GPIO's 9-14\nDefault SPI pins for FSPI:\nCS0 = 10\nSCK = 12\nMISO = 13\nMOSI = 35  ?\n(last one is strange. Hardware\nimplies it should be 11, but\nthe IDF uses 35...)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 101.6 73.66 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "66c7bdd0-b018-425d-9b4e-adbf6547b788")
	)
	(text "~~ GPIO count ~~\nUnrestricted = 31\nSpecial = 6s (0, 45, 46, Tx, Rx)\nUnused if possible = 1u (26)\n\nGPIB = 16\n\nI2C-internal = 2s (Rx, Tx)\n- FUSB302 = 1s (45)\n- INT (TBD) = 1s (IO46)\n\nUSB-PD = 2\n\nSPI common = 3\n- Ethernet CS/INT/RST = 3\n- NOR flash (16MB) = 1\n\nTotal (remaining) = 25 + 4s (6 +2s)\n\n?? USB alt mode = 2-10\n?? Piicodev connector = 2 each\n?? 4pin JST connector = 2 each\n  "
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 134.62 7.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a98d76a0-0171-4b63-bbce-6d1bfed9ae1f")
	)
	(text "Todo (old)\n\n- Finish USB-C PD circuit\n- Add Current measurement IC\n- Add temperature measurment IC\nAll of the above as I2C devices :)\n- Debug MUX on USB port?\n- Add ESP32-C3 co-processor?\n- W5500 Ethernet.\n- RS485?\n- Audio?"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 175.26 279.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.54 2.54)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b9b4a7d1-d542-4866-92a5-e5312891d177")
	)
	(text "${TITLE}"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 180.34 7.62 0)
		(effects
